# Purpose: explicit site/CDN proxy exceptions.
# Format: Mihomo classical/text. Policy: foreign traffic selector.
# Priority: before generic blocking, geographic and UDP/443 rules.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,linux.do
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,jsdelivr.net
# 91cg: site, image host, HLS playlist and segment hosts.
DOMAIN-REGEX,(?i)(^|[.])91cg[a-z0-9-]*[.]((com|net|org|co)[.])?[a-z0-9-]+$
DOMAIN,pic.nsxxlj.cn
DOMAIN,op.udhhzr.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ucjosl.cn
